name: Lucky Cat — lucky-trigger X-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Lucky Cat gains X0.25 Mult every time a Lucky card successfully triggers. First-shop
  scaling: needs a Lucky card to appear; then use Aura/Deja Vu to create more Lucky cards
  and Oops All 6s to double trigger chances.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: LuckyCat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
